OL,3,GNEWSAWe turned a VW Beetle into a Hot
OL,4,AWheels car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car enthusiast has transformed a
OL,7,FVolkswagen Beetle into a life-sized Hot
OL,8,FWheels model.
OL,10,FIt has an aerial made from an old
OL,11,Fkitchen whisk, chrome trim from kitchen
OL,12,Fdoor handles, and its plastic roof dome
OL,13,Fcame from the ceiling of a school
OL,14,Ftoilet.
OL,16,FNow the pimped up classic is in the
OL,17,Frunning for an international award and
OL,18,Fcould be made into a collectible
OL,19,Fminiature.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
