OL,3,GNEWSAWe turned a VW Beetle into a Hot
OL,4,AWheels car
OL,5,
OL,6,FRay Ramsay, 64, who runs a workshop in
OL,7,FGuyhirn, Cambridgeshire, said the 1972
OL,8,Fvehicle ` named the Riddler ` was never
OL,9,Fintended to look like the tiny model
OL,10,Fcars: "It's just evolved into that."
